  "body": "Imagine waking up to the sound of the waves and having a backyard that stretches into a regional park and marine reserve. Experience the ultimate coastal lifestyle with this brand-new design-build home by David Reid Homes, located in the heart of Long Bay.\r\n\r\nKey Features:\r\nPrime Location: Walking distance to Long Bay Beach and the vibrant new village centre with cafés, bars, eateries, and boutique shopping.\r\nQuality Build: Designed and built by David Reid Homes, a trusted name in high-quality construction, with a comprehensive Master Builders Guarantee included for peace of mind.\r\nSpacious Design: 207m² of architecturally designed living space on a generous 1,231m² section, offering room for modern family living and entertaining.\r\nOutdoor Paradise: Embrace the Long Bay Effect with picturesque coastal landscapes, open spaces, and the tranquility of nature right at your doorstep.\r\nSchool Zoning: In zone for the highly regarded Long Bay College, making it ideal for families.\r\n\r\nNestled along Auckland's stunning coastline, Long Bay is a seaside town that blends the beauty of nature with urban convenience. From its sandy beach to its vibrant village centre, the area offers an unparalleled lifestyle with easy access to transport links, recreational parks, and community amenities.\r\n\r\nThis is your opportunity to build the life you've always dreamed of, in a home that exudes quality and style. Don't miss out-contact Dean today for more information or visit the David Reid Homes website at http://www.davidreidhomes.co.nz to explore the possibilities.\r\n\r\nSecure your slice of paradise and make the Long Bay Effect your reality!",
